# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": any line may use any name the block binds; the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 8 (`<-` binds the branch's plain result) and ruling TC (places counted as built: the `else` branch builds place 1, so the last label is 2; the first branch builds none, so it is 1). Never run: prismc refuses the program.
